Compilation flags:
========================================
Enable : MODEL=HYDRO, EOS=ISOTHERMAL, SUPPORT_TURBGEN
Disable: COMOVING, PARTICLE, GRAVITY


Default setup:
========================================
1. Enable TurbGen before compiling:
   (1) Get TurbGen from https://github.com/chfeder/turbulence_generator.git
   (2) Setup TURBGEN_PATH in config file to include "TurbGen.h"

2. Code units:
   (1) Dimensionless OPT__UNIT=0
   (2) Magnetic field is scaled to MagZ=Turb_B0/UNIT_B -> initial magnetic energy density = 0.5*Turb_B0^2/(4*pi)
   (3) Adjust MOLECULAR_WEIGHT and ISO_TEMP so Cs=1

3. BOX_SIZE         1
   NX0_TOT_X        64
   NX0_TOT_Y        64
   NX0_TOT_Z        64

4. MAX_LEVEL        0
   OPT__BC_FLU_*    1  (periodic)

5. END_T            default to 100 code unit


TurbGen parameters (setup in TurbGen.par):
==========================================
ndim                3
L                   1     equal to BOX_SIZE
velocity            0.2   target velocity dispersion
ampl_factor         1     adjust this factor if dispersion measured is different from target velocity
ampl_auto_adjust    0     this parameter is actually not used in the current version of TurbGen
k_driv              5     driving scale, this will affect Ornstein-Uhlenbeck auto-correlation time (turnover time): t_decay = L/(velocity*k_driv)
sol_weight          1
spect_form          1     paraboloid
kmin                1
kmax                3
nsteps_per_t_turb   200   number of turbulence driving pattern updates per turnover time, so dt for OU process = t_decay/nsteps_per_t_turb

Note:
   OU variance is hard coded as sqrt(energy/t_decay), where "energy" is the energy injection rate = (0.15*velocity)^3/L
